Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:58:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] MAINTAINERS: Add CS7542 global control support

Track the global control binding, strap clock provider and pin
multiplexer independently of the pending platform series.

AI assistance: Codex prepared this change from the existing OpenWrt port
and GPL vendor sources.

Signed-off-by: Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20261123-cs7542-syscon-v3-5-f1c07a1703f8@gmail.com/
---
 MAINTAINERS | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

--- a/MAINTAINERS
+++ b/MAINTAINERS
@@ -2642,6 +2642,16 @@ F:	tools/perf/tests/shell/lib/*coresight
 F:	tools/perf/util/cs-etm-decoder/*
 F:	tools/perf/util/cs-etm.*
 
+ARM/CORTINA SYSTEMS CS7542 GLOBAL CONTROL
+M:	Fil Dunsky <filipp.dunsky@gmail.com>
+L:	linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org (moderated for non-subscribers)
+S:	Maintained
